{"games":[{"id":17046374415,"name":"[🐲 DB + Elemental 🔥]  Anime Reborn","desc":"New Units, New Game modes, New Maps & Added Portals!\n\nWelcome to Anime Reborn!\n\n⚔️ Step into the world of Anime Reborn, an action-packed tower defense game where legendary anime heroes come together to defend against relentless waves of enemies!\n\n✨ Summon powerful units from across the anime universe, each with their own unique abilities, and strategically deploy them to defend your base!\n🚀 Upgrade and evolve your units during battle to unlock devastating new attacks and abilities!\n🔥 Battle through exciting story mode or challenge yourself in infinite mode to prove your ultimate strength!\n\n📱💻 Play on **All Devices** and defend your territory with friends!\n🎁 Like and join the community for special codes and rewards, including FREE VIP Servers!","path":"/game/17046374415-anime-reborn","slug":"17046374415-anime-reborn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/474ed939e5485fce0a30d25490e5661301259330cbb47b5e0a85e2f37bdb1f5d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ad6b580720ee8c4e01ae23e658dcaf74/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":7,"visitor":153727434,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-30T15:43:40.595Z","creator":{"name":"AnimeReborn","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":10,"freeCount":9,"keyCount":9,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":73727760725654,"name":"Steal a Capybara","desc":"🌟 Welcome to Steal a Capybara!\n\n👍 LIKE THE GAME AND JOIN GROUP!!\n⏳ Guaranteed Godly Capybara Spawns at: 60,000+ LIKES\n\nHow to Play:\n💰 Buy Capybaras\n🤝 Steal Capybaras from other players\n💸 Get LOTS of Money\n✋ Buy Weapons and Troll Gear to Troll other players!\n\n💻 Game available for: PC, Mobile, Tablet and Console players","path":"/game/73727760725654-steal-a-capybara","slug":"73727760725654-steal-a-capybara","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/080c208364189bb379689642da97664b8d574287eaa1f81b0e06778d777de869.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-1869d49b075d5dea529c42a9edff